Package: com.itsallexb.defaultapps
Name: DefaultApps (iOS 12)
Version: 3.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Choose your default browser, mail app and maps app on iOS 12, like iOS 14. Web links open in Firefox, Chrome, Brave, DuckDuckGo and more; mailto: links open in Gmail, Outlook, Spark, Yahoo Mail, Proton Mail and more; Apple Maps links open in Google Maps, Waze and more. Only installed apps are offered. Settings > Default Apps. Replaces DefaultBrowser.
Maintainer: itsAllexB
Author: itsAllexB
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0), preferenceloader
Replaces: com.itsallexb.defaultbrowser (<< 2.0.2), com.itsallexb.firefoxdefault
Breaks: com.itsallexb.defaultbrowser (<< 2.0.2)
Conflicts: com.itsallexb.firefoxdefault
Provides: com.itsallexb.firefoxdefault
